Package: mcGLM
Title: Bias Corrections for GLMs with Misclassified Covariates
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Michał", "Warmuz", role = "aut",
           email = "mwarmuz@student.agh.edu.pl"),
    person("Maciej", "Beresewicz", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "maciej.beresewicz@ue.poznan.pl",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-8281-4301"))
           )
Description: Implements additive (BCA), multiplicative (BCM), and corrected-score
    (CS) bias corrections for generalized linear models when a covariate is
    observed with misclassification error. Supports binary and multicategory
    misclassified covariates. Based on the framework of Battaglia et al. (2025).
